WEBVTT

00:00.417 --> 00:02.083
[Keys typing.]

00:02.083 --> 00:04.167
[Wind, and a low hum.]

00:07.500 --> 00:10.000
[Soft digging.]

00:12.500 --> 00:15.833
[Rain begins.]

00:19.167 --> 00:23.333
Give a little. It gives back more.

00:25.833 --> 00:29.167
[Water runs down into the dark. Soft music.]

00:35.000 --> 00:38.333
[Wooden knocks. A wheel starts to turn.]

00:43.333 --> 00:48.333
[Soft piano and brushes. The days pass.]

00:48.333 --> 00:52.500
[Crickets at dusk.]

00:53.333 --> 00:56.250
All of this, from one seed.

00:56.667 --> 01:00.000
Every afternoon leaves a layer.
Concept render · in development · working title
